-- SEED_DATA.sql — system reference data, dumped from the live MiniERP database
--   source: server/database/erp.db (authoritative); all INSERT OR IGNORE (idempotent)
--   Pair with CURRENT_SCHEMA.sql (see SCHEMA_AND_SEED.md).
--   NOT included: transactional/business data (customers, invoices, items, stock,
--   employees, conversations, ...) — copy database/erp.db from the kit for those.
--   No admin user is seeded: the server creates admin/admin123 at startup.

